Delius, who were followed by Sommer, Rosemeyer and Villapadierna.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":15,"text":"Nuvolari set a new lap record on lap 15 in 2m00s, which placed him four seconds ahead of Caracciola.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":20,"text":"after 20 laps the gap had decreased and Nuvolari was now only two seconds ahead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":23,"text":"Nuvolari laps in 1m59s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":24,"text":"Farina had passed Chiron for third place on lap 24, when Chiron lost some time","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":28,"text":"Nuvolari, seven seconds ahead on lap 26, answers Caracciola with a 1m58s lap.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":39,"text":"Just before half distance on lap 39, Nuvolari made a quick pit stop, refueled and changed his rear tires in only 40 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":39,"text":"Rosemeyer's reserve tank breaks loose again; it is removed and he falls to last.","q":false,"c":4},{"lap":40,"text":"After 40 laps Caracciola was leading Nuvolari by 28 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":52,"text":"Farina stops for fuel and tires.","q":false,"c":2},{"lap":53,"text":"A piece of tire flies off Caracciola's Mercedes; he crawls to the pits for fuel and rear tires and Nuvolari leads by 40 seconds.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":60,"text":"On lap 60, Nuvolari made a quick pit stop to change one defective front tire without losing the lead. When he rejoined the race, his advantage to Caracciola was still 27 seconds.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"On the same lap a dog crossed the straight in front of the grandstands and was just missed by Farina and Rosemeyer.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":67,"text":"Caracciola, signalled to speed up, is 24 seconds behind.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":70,"text":"Nuvolari's lead is down to 17 seconds; Rosemeyer is ready to pass Chiron for fifth.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":74,"text":"Nuvolari waves off signals to change his worn rear tires; the gap is 16 seconds.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":78,"text":"after lap 78, Nuvolari's advantage was only 10 seconds. The Alfa's rear tires were in poor shape.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":79,"text":"Nine seconds was the Italian's advantage as they went into the last lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":80,"text":"Nuvolari wins on shredded tires, 3.4 seconds ahead of Caracciola; Farina third, three laps down.","q":false,"c":0}]}